No matter the car, the color,

00:00:49.620 --> 00:00:51.700
or even the time of day or night,

00:00:51.700 --> 00:00:55.000
this veteran is an able volunteer for victory in Tennessee.

00:00:55.000 --> 00:00:56.620
A six-pack of wins here,

00:00:56.620 --> 00:01:00.000
but Rusty hasn't flashed that winning smile in 34 races.

00:01:00.190 --> 00:01:04.590
