00:01:04.590 --> 00:01:07.290
Rusty Wallace is searching for that fine line

00:01:07.290 --> 00:01:09.690
between pressure and praise.

00:01:09.690 --> 00:01:12.750
And this is the perfect place for Rusty to race right now

00:01:12.750 --> 00:01:14.550
in the mountains of East Tennessee,

00:01:14.550 --> 00:01:17.290
